headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
}

docs {
  Every API call needs a login token. Run auth/Login first (or auth/Setup the very first time): it saves the
  token in the "token" variable, which every request sends as "Authorization: Bearer <token>". Tokens last 8 hours;
  log in again when you get 401. Put your username in the environment's "user" and your password in "password"
  (mark it secret in Bruno so it is not saved to the file).
}
